{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Legislate to ensure clear labels for products that have been tested on animals",
        "additional_details": "We have the Leaping Bunny program and other cruelty free labels but they are printed few and far between and sometimes products aren\u2019t part of a program as such. We  feel we need to be made aware of what products have been tested on animals. We believe this transparency will help us make informed choices about what products we use as consumers. Often normal day to day items that you would think are cruelty free are not \u2013 we need the public to have the choice and to be made aware.",
        "background": "Bring in a labelling law, for everything from toothpastes & weed killers to pharmaceutical drugs, to show if the products you\u2019re buying or using are tested on animals. We want to be made aware of what has been tested on animals and how, so we can make an informed and ethical choice going forward",
